            {
                "entry_id": "04497932-ac9d-3a55-8e96-db2dfc69f6e5",
                "word": "tertio",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0f5f4180-4cd3-34ba-934c-033d076a5571",
                        "entry_id": "04497932-ac9d-3a55-8e96-db2dfc69f6e5",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Troisièmement, en troisième lieu. Il s’emploie pour désigner le troisième article d’une série, quand on a commencé à compter par primo et secundo."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9ca08a2e-9eb7-4291-aacc-582518fc59e9",
                                "sense_id": "0f5f4180-4cd3-34ba-934c-033d076a5571",
                                "text": "— Primo, cette pouf n’était pas à poil, deuxio, cette pouf n’est pas une pouf, et tertio, tu as 18 ans, et je crois qu’il est temps d’abandonner cette règle."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "eb908ae9-9bdc-456a-bbf5-706aa0300473",
                                "sense_id": "0f5f4180-4cd3-34ba-934c-033d076a5571",
                                "text": "– Primo, Charles n’est pas aux ordres de Mademoiselle. Deuzio, rira bien qui rira le dernier. Tertio…\nN’imaginant pas ce que pourrait être ce tertio, elle conclut :\n– Ça t’en bouche un coin, hein !"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5845e7a4-b8ac-4a07-aa60-dc01d688e9bb",
                        "source_entry_id": "04497932-ac9d-3a55-8e96-db2dfc69f6e5",
                        "source_sense_id": "0f5f4180-4cd3-34ba-934c-033d076a5571",
                        "target_lang_word": "third",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "third",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e9443bb8-ba8e-31c4-b28a-67de9181c960",
                                        "entry_id": "c71402b6-c426-3066-b627-8bdb9eb6b973",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The ordinal form of the cardinal number three; Coming after the second."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0918d05f-fbd8-4fef-8062-f97296cf88d7",
                                                "sense_id": "e9443bb8-ba8e-31c4-b28a-67de9181c960",
                                                "text": "The third tree from the left is my favorite."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ee4c7b97-3f1e-4c0e-a7bc-78d56532f5d3",
                                                "sense_id": "e9443bb8-ba8e-31c4-b28a-67de9181c960",
                                                "text": "The second and third quarters of the shield are indecipherable on the stone but clearer in two other representations of the arms, a painted wooden funeral hatchment for Mary Davie[…]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7723bb7a-d513-48d3-a8b0-be4adf7dbaed",
                                                "sense_id": "e9443bb8-ba8e-31c4-b28a-67de9181c960",
                                                "text": "“Congress took the lead on putting the HBCU funding in those bills and passing them. The third COVID-19 bill, passed under President Biden, included as much funding for HBCUs as both of the first two Covid-19 bills under President Trump,” he said."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "third",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a55225fa-8f56-32b6-b55f-b0136fe54ce1",
                                        "entry_id": "5ece8680-a3e3-3ad6-8365-30a9c8d3899e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The person or thing in the third position."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9f51ac64-bc54-4bad-a9ca-57560dda32e4",
                                                "sense_id": "a55225fa-8f56-32b6-b55f-b0136fe54ce1",
                                                "text": "Jones came in third."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "51b99bfc-8a42-30a9-99fd-8c6e4f3f076e",
                                        "entry_id": "5ece8680-a3e3-3ad6-8365-30a9c8d3899e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One of three equal parts of a whole."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "159d3120-0655-45f9-844d-69a67e798c76",
                                                "sense_id": "51b99bfc-8a42-30a9-99fd-8c6e4f3f076e",
                                                "text": "He ate a third of the pie. Divided by two-thirds."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8c547e5d-0446-4edb-9eb7-197fd2e69f25",
                                                "sense_id": "51b99bfc-8a42-30a9-99fd-8c6e4f3f076e",
                                                "text": "Around a third of both Black and White respondents said they believed the opposition Labour Party to be institutionally racist."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9a9bb91d-d5a1-4837-aa4f-d46ffe8748cb",
                                                "sense_id": "51b99bfc-8a42-30a9-99fd-8c6e4f3f076e",
                                                "text": "Despite these uncertainties, Clarke told MPs he was convinced of the need to order trains powered by batteries. He said: \"We're calling for a 'no regrets' order of battery trains because we see them always having a future. We see them being fundable, financeable, similar cost to diesel trains, and we know that however much electrification we would aspire to do, there's always going to be at least a third of the network that isn't electrified."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "29390703-744a-3e1a-9df3-e1409f23cefa",
                                        "entry_id": "5ece8680-a3e3-3ad6-8365-30a9c8d3899e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The third gear of a gearbox."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "644aaadc-f796-4f66-83e0-75b78133a6a6",
                                                "sense_id": "29390703-744a-3e1a-9df3-e1409f23cefa",
                                                "text": "Now put it into third."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0c4482cb-a289-3abb-bd59-2605cefe262d",
                                        "entry_id": "5ece8680-a3e3-3ad6-8365-30a9c8d3899e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An interval consisting of the first and third notes in a scale."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "75f320cc-727a-4d47-b0ad-d455e3687ab4",
                                                "sense_id": "0c4482cb-a289-3abb-bd59-2605cefe262d",
                                                "text": "They sing in thirds."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2dfbec6f-bfec-30e3-b08a-265eb3abaa7f",
                                        "entry_id": "5ece8680-a3e3-3ad6-8365-30a9c8d3899e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "third base"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
